          "iast": "bhartṛ sneha pra coditā",
          "devanagari": "भर्तृ स्नेह प्र चोदिता",
          "meaning": "husband's, friendship, well, motivated by",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 12
        },
        {
