          "iast": "eṣā sītā iha yathā ramate",
          "devanagari": "एषा सीता इह यथा रमते",
          "meaning": "this, Seetha, here, as to how, she takes delight",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "tathaa kuru",
          "iast": "tathā kuru",
          "devanagari": "तथा कुरु",
