          "meaning": "she, in forest, you, following",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.13.5",
      "label": "3.13.5",
      "numbers": [
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "एषा हि प्रकृतिः स्त्रीणाम् आसृष्टे रघुनंदन |\nसमस्थम् अनुरंजंते विषमस्थम् त्यजन्ति च",
      "iast": "eṣā hi prakṛtiḥ strīṇām āsṛṣṭe raghunaṃdana |\nsamastham anuraṃjaṃte viṣamastham tyajanti ca",
      "translation": "\"From the beginning of creation the nature of women is this way only, oh scion of Raghu, they devote themselves to their men in good fortune, but they leave them off in ill fortune.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "raghunandana",
