          "meaning": "likewise, eagle, gust of wind, speediness of",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.13.7",
      "label": "3.13.7",
      "numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "इयम् तु भवतो भार्या दोषैर् एतैर् विवर्जिताः |\nश्लाघ्या च व्यपदेश्या च यथा देवी हि अरुन्धती",
      "iast": "iyam tu bhavato bhāryā doṣair etair vivarjitāḥ |\nślāghyā ca vyapadeśyā ca yathā devī hi arundhatī",
      "translation": "\"But she this wife of yours is devoid of all those stigmas, an exemplary and an estimable lady, like Lady Arundhati.",
      "notes": [
        "Lady Arundhati is the wife of Sage Vashishta, an exemplary lady in devotion to her husband and she has become a star in the sky by virtue of that devotion. Even today in marriages, at the close of all observances, this star in skies is shown to the bride imbuing a sense of devotion to her bridegroom, may it be in noontime."
      ],
      "glosses": [
        {
